From 0ebfae7bc7dacae19a055cfa740268ec5936ef04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 03:26:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Link swift-nio-ssh into LiveContainerSwiftUI, pinned

Cartouche's launcher, which joins LiveContainerSwiftUI, reaches the
player's own SFTP servers with Apple's swift-nio-ssh. The project gets
remote package references to swift-nio-ssh and swift-nio at exact
versions, the LiveContainerSwiftUI framework links NIOSSH, NIOCore and
NIOPosix, and the workspace's Package.resolved pins every package of the
graph to a revision, which app/scripts/build.sh resolves from only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MzPJorvBGmBB88WUcRVhE7
