 .../xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved     | 68 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 113 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 LiveContainer.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved

